WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
Open a bottle of perfume in
one corner of a still room.

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.070
Within minutes, you can
smell it on the other side.

3
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:08.570
Wait as long as you like, though.

4
00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.370
It never gathers back into the bottle.

5
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:16.250
Why does perfume spread across a room,
but never gather back into the bottle?

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.270
In this mission, you'll meet entropy,

7
00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:22.630
and compare the entropy of
solids, liquids and gases.

8
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.630
You'll predict the sign
of an entropy change,

9
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.770
and calculate it from standard entropies.

10
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:32.840
Your mission: explain why perfume
spreads out but never gathers back in.
